---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="O mnie">
  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-16 px-6 pb-24 pt-32 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-12 md:pt-40">
    <!-- Swap for: <img src="/images/marta-portrait.jpg" alt="Marta Kukla" class="h-full w-full object-cover" /> -->
    <div class="portrait-placeholder aspect-[3/4] w-full"></div>

    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
      <p class="mb-4 font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest2 text-ivory-muted">
        <span class="pl">O artystce</span><span class="en">About the artist</span>
      </p>
      <h1 class="mb-8 font-serif text-5xl font-extralight text-ivory md:text-6xl">Marta Kukla</h1>

      <div class="space-y-5 font-serif text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-ivory-muted md:text-xl">
        <p>
          <span class="pl">
            Maluje od ponad piętnastu lat, szukając w oleju i akrylu momentów, które trudno opisać słowami —
            ciszy przed świtem, zapachu terpentyny w pracowni, linii, która pojawia się przypadkiem i zostaje
            na zawsze.
          </span>
          <span class="en">
            She has been painting for over fifteen years, searching in oil and acrylic for moments that are
            hard to put into words — the silence before dawn, the smell of turpentine in the studio, a line
            that appears by accident and stays for good.
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span class="pl">
            Jej prace znajdują się w kolekcjach prywatnych w Polsce, Niemczech i Wielkiej Brytanii. Pracuje
            w pracowni pod Wrocławiem, gdzie światło zmienia się co godzinę.
          </span>
          <span class="en">
            Her work is held in private collections across Poland, Germany, and the United Kingdom. She works
            from a studio near Wrocław, where the light changes by the hour.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <a
        href="/katalog"
        class="brush-underline mt-10 self-start font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest2 text-ivory hover:drop-shadow-neon-turquoise"
        style="--accent:#00f5d4"
      >
        <span class="pl">Zobacz katalog prac →</span>
        <span class="en">View the catalogue →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .portrait-placeholder {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 60% 20%, rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.12), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 80%, rgba(0, 245, 212, 0.1), transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #1a1a1a, #121212);
  }
</style>
